  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/006771b9f7ae321438e7a68b16f53e90db3c3f96a3a6990265d3b29dd3f68a2a.png] \n\n \n \n\n \n \nSymbol\n\n \n \n \n$\n\n \n \n \n#\n\n \n \n \n&\n\n \n \n \n@\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nMeaning\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\nGiven equation: 66 @ 11 & (12 $ 13) # (42 @ 14) # 12 & 3\n\nAfter replacing the symbols by their meaning, we get\n\n66 ÷ 11 × (12 + 13) - (42 ÷ 14) - 12 × 3\n\n= 66 ÷ 11 × (12 + 13) - __(42 ____÷____ 14)__ - 12 × 3\n\n= 66 ÷ 11 × __(12 + 13)__ - 3 - 12 × 3\n\n= __66 ____÷____ 11__ × 25 - 3 - 12 × 3\n\n= __6 ____×____ 25 __- 3 - __12 ____× 3__\n\n= 150 __- 3____ - 36__\n\n= __150 - 39__\n\n= 111.\n\nHence, **\"111\"** is the correct answer.",
